      "writtenOn": "2026-08-11T14:44:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While there may well be a real bug here, this patch feels like a hack and is almost certainly not the right solution. Some of the claims in the commit message sound suspicious and I think a more thorough performance analysis is in order before we can make an informed decision about how to proceed.\n\nRegarding the IGD discovery timeout, the rationale offered for increasing it appears to be based on a misunderstanding. Even if there were good reasons to change the timeout, this should be done in a separate patch, after the performance issues are fixed.",
      "revId": "841268add1fd7055092b81b7cfac037c62e9b7ea",
